    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds pretty definitive. but what about the actual logistics? i keep hearing about the massive issues with mineral shortages for batteries, the instability of the grid when the wind isnt blowing, and just how much it's gonna cost developing nations to ditch cheap fossil fuels. isn't there a huge risk that the \"inevitability\" ignores these massive economic and technical hurdles?",
